==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
*2 [[Youcan]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 66.67~80 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Thanks to the low cash supply, a Rich Cat is recommended here.

Fighting both Youcan and Aku Gory is a terrible idea, so do your best to kill the first Aku Gory as fast as possible. This can be accomplished through good meatshielding, [[Can Can Cat]], and [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] abusing Cerberus Kids and Aku Doges as a stepping stone. Once you kill the Aku Gory, you fight a Youcan and another Aku Gory. Use Breakerblast to destroy Youcan's Barrier, then do your best to survive. [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can deal serious damage to the Aku Gory and Youcan, and what's left of Aku Gory can be taken down using Can Can. From there, just beat up the Youcan using units like [[Mushroom Cat]] and Can Can.

The second phase of the level has Loris, Sir Rel, and another Youcan, while Nyandam sits at the back nuking everything. Again, use Mushroom and Breakerblast for the Youcan, while timing your units so that they don't get Cursed by Loris. There's a lot less pushing power here, so you can take your time and use meatshields to stall everything.

===3 Crown Strategy===
450% Aku Gory sucks. It's pretty hard to kill Aku Gory using your 1 Crown strategies, so a good option is luring Aku Gory to your base, then using [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]] to chain it. When the second Aku Gory comes, use a good Bahamut chain to kill him. The rest of the level plays out like normal, although do make sure you kill the first Youcan fast so that you don't have to do the Loris section while both Youcans are alive.

